        <body>
            <div xml:id="d561-a1">

                <pb facs="0669" n="571" sameAs="frus:frus1920v01/pg571"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Enclosure 1]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">List of Documents Communicated to the Chinese
                        Government Respecting Organization of a New Consortium</hi></head>
                <list>
                    <label>1.</label>
                    <item>State Dept. letter to American Group Banks of July 9, 1918.<anchor n="98"
                            xml:id="d561-f1"/></item>
                    <label>2.</label>
                    <item>State Dept. Note and Memo, to Embassies of Oct. 8, 1918.<anchor n="99"
                            xml:id="d561-f2"/></item>
                    <label>3.</label>
                    <item>State Dept. Note to Embassies of May 31, 1919.<anchor n="1"
                            xml:id="d561-f3"/></item>
                    <label>4.</label>
                    <item>Odagiri-Lamont exchange of letters. <list>
                            <item>Odagiri to Lamont, June 18, 1919.<anchor n="2" xml:id="d561-f4"
                                /></item>
                            <item>Lamont to Odagiri, June 23, 1919.<anchor n="3" xml:id="d561-f5"
                                /></item>
                        </list></item>
                    <label>5.</label>
                    <item>Memo, from State Dept. to Japanese Foreign Office, July, 1919.<anchor
                            n="4" xml:id="d561-f6"/></item>
                    <label>6.</label>
                    <item>Exchange of Memoranda between the British Foreign Office and Japanese
                        Embassy. <list>
                            <item>Foreign Office to Embassy, August 11, 1919.<anchor n="5"
                                    xml:id="d561-f7"/></item>
                            <item>Foreign Office to Embassy, Nov. 20, 1919.<anchor n="6"
                                    xml:id="d561-f8"/></item>
                        </list></item>
                    <label>7.</label>
                    <item>Exchange of Memoranda between Japanese Government and Governments of Great
                        Britain, France and the United States, March-May, 1920: <list>
                            <label>(<hi rendition="#italic">a</hi>)</label>
                            <item>Japanese Govt. to Great Britain, March 16.<anchor n="7"
                                    xml:id="d561-f9"/></item>
                            <pb facs="0670" n="572" xml:id="pg572"/>
                            <label>(<hi rendition="#italic">b</hi>)</label>
                            <item>From State Dept., March 16,<anchor n="8" xml:id="d561-f10"
                                /></item>
                            <label>(<hi rendition="#italic">c</hi>)</label>
                            <item>From British Government, March 19.<anchor n="9" xml:id="d561-f11"
                                /></item>
                            <label>(<hi rendition="#italic">d</hi>)</label>
                            <item>From Japanese Government, April 14.<anchor n="10"
                                    xml:id="d561-f12"/></item>
                            <label>(<hi rendition="#italic">e</hi>)</label>
                            <item>From British Government, April <hi rendition="#italic"
                                    >28.</hi><anchor n="11" xml:id="d561-f13"/></item>
                            <label>(<hi rendition="#italic">f</hi>)</label>
                            <item>From Japanese Government, May 10.<anchor n="12" xml:id="d561-f14"
                                /></item>
                            <label>(<hi rendition="#italic">g</hi>)</label>
                            <item>From British Government, May 17.<anchor n="13" xml:id="d561-f15"
                                /></item>
                            <label>(<hi rendition="#italic">h</hi>)</label>
                            <item>From French Government, May 25.<anchor n="14" xml:id="d561-f16"
                                /></item>
                        </list></item>
                    <label>8.</label>
                    <item>Kajiwara–Lamont exchange of letters of May 11, 1920.<anchor n="15"
                            xml:id="d561-f17"/></item>
                </list>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
